  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Every Saturday, Jaylen and his friends played at Sunset Beach.",
      "startSeconds": 0,
      "durationSeconds": 4.175
    },
    {
      "text": "But one morning, they found plastic bottles, chip bags, and old fishing line tangled everywhere.",
      "startSeconds": 4.475,
      "durationSeconds": 6.4
    },
    {
      "text": "\"This is horrible,\" said Jaylen, looking at a seagull trying to eat a piece of plastic.",
      "startSeconds": 11.175,
      "durationSeconds": 5.65
    },
    {
      "text": "He felt sick to his stomach.",
      "startSeconds": 17.125,
      "durationSeconds": 2.15
    },
    {
      "text": "Their neighbor, Ms. Rivera, told them about a town in Oregon where kids organized a beach cleanup and now the beach is one of the cleanest in the state.",
      "startSeconds": 19.975,
      "durationSeconds": 9.75
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Kids just like you did that,\" she said.",
      "startSeconds": 30.025,
      "durationSeconds": 2.85
    },
    {
      "text": "Jaylen's eyes lit up.",
      "startSeconds": 33.175,
      "durationSeconds": 2.075
    },
    {
      "text": "\"We could do that here!\"",
      "startSeconds": 35.55,
      "durationSeconds": 1.775
    },
    {
      "text": "They made a plan: every Saturday morning, they'd bring bags and gloves.",
      "startSeconds": 38.025,
      "durationSeconds": 4.825
    },
    {
      "text": "Jaylen would make posters for the neighborhood.",
      "startSeconds": 43.15,
      "durationSeconds": 2.925
    },
    {
      "text": "Sofia would ask the school for supplies.",
      "startSeconds": 46.375,
      "durationSeconds": 2.85
    },
    {
      "text": "And Marcus would count and sort what they collected.",
      "startSeconds": 49.525,
      "durationSeconds": 3.45
    },
    {
      "text": "The first cleanup day, twelve kids showed up.",
      "startSeconds": 53.675,
      "durationSeconds": 3.125
    },
    {
      "text": "They filled nine bags of trash.",
      "startSeconds": 57.1,
      "durationSeconds": 2.475
    },
    {
      "text": "By the end of the month, they had removed over 200 pounds of waste from the beach.",
      "startSeconds": 59.875,
      "durationSeconds": 5.15
    },
    {
      "text": "The seagulls were back, and so were the tide pool creatures.",
      "startSeconds": 65.325,
      "durationSeconds": 3.875
    }
  ],
